	)
	(text "Power-up order (doc/specifications.md of IHP-TO-2026-11): IOVDD first, ring VDD no later than vdd_rf.\nThe LT3042 enables are chained by power good: IOVDD -> VDD -> VDD_RF, VDD_RO, VDD_HV.\nA bench supply on a tip jack bypasses that order: bring IOVDD up first by hand.\nEvery 1.2 V domain is limited to 1.65 V by its base R_SET, whatever the jumpers say.\nThe current shunts sit after the current jumpers, the INA226 reads them over I2C (SDA, SCL from the Pico)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 205.74 25.4 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "03458e56-1d11-5509-a7bb-fd69b5b69510")
	)
